# Copy to .env for local `astro dev` / `npm run build`. Astro/Vite only expose
# PUBLIC_-prefixed vars to client-side code — see README.md "Pricing / Stripe checkout".
#
# PUBLIC_STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY is the client-side publishable key (pk_test_... /
# pk_live_...) from Stripe Dashboard → Developers → API keys — safe to expose.
# pricing.astro fails the build if this is unset, so you never ship a page silently
# missing checkout. STRIPE_SECRET_KEY and STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET are server-side only —
# those go in .dev.vars (see .dev.vars.example), never here.
PUBLIC_STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=pk_test_...
